// A landlord: one rental house bought on 2024-12-18 and sold on 2025-12-29, with a
// day job. Tax year 2025.
//
// The folders are constraints: journal/2024/12.ax holds December 2024 only.

base USD

use std
use us

// The house's price is the one thing the world tells us. In a real project a
// script fetches it; here the script only prints what the county's assessor and
// a listing site said, so `axiom sync` would rewrite prices/home.ax to the same text.
sync prices/home.ax
  run sh scripts/home-prices.sh

/// Jamie, 45, a nurse practitioner, single, with a rental on the side. Washington
/// has no income tax, so `lives us` is the whole story.
entity me : person
  born   1980-05-02
  filing single
  lives  us
